{"unit_id":"zhangzujian__dsh-subprocess-inherit-environment#card-zh","repo":"zhangzujian/dsh-subprocess-inherit-environment","commit":"3f4884f3fb5f1de59fb639866368de3f7b4661bb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subprocess-inherit-environment 是一个适用于 DSH 的插件，通过 subprocess 服务为子进程补充 Harness 进程的环境变量。它包装 resolveExecutable、spawn 和 spawnTerminal，在每次调用时先复制当前 process.env，再合并调用方明确提供的环境项。插件安装时检查运行时方法和安装标记，避免同一运行时重复启用；卸载时停用包装器并恢复原方法。适合需要让 DSH 子进程读取 Harness 环境配置的场景。它不需要额外账号或 API 配置，要求 Node.js 22 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:14-18","index.mjs:30-52","index.mjs:124-249"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangzujian__dsh-subprocess-inherit-environment#card-en","repo":"zhangzujian/dsh-subprocess-inherit-environment","commit":"3f4884f3fb5f1de59fb639866368de3f7b4661bb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-subprocess-inherit-environment passes the Harness environment to DSH subprocesses. It wraps resolveExecutable, spawn, and spawnTerminal, merging current process.env with caller entries. On disposal, it restores the original methods. Requires Node.js 22 or later.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:14-18","index.mjs:30-52","index.mjs:124-249"]}
